# NOTICE

This repository contains code derived from the following open-source projects.
Each component remains under its upstream license. Files listed as "modified"
were adapted for this project (interface changes, Chinese prompts, Neo4j-backed
graph storage, token accounting, etc.).

## HippoRAG

- Upstream: https://github.com/OSU-NLP-Group/HippoRAG
- License: MIT
- Location: `core/data_connections/retrievers/knowlege_graph_retrievers/hipproRAG/`
- Status: modified. The upstream implementation was adapted to use Neo4j as the
  graph store, an OpenAI-compatible embedding service, and project-specific
