## RAGChecker

- Upstream: https://github.com/amazon-science/RAGChecker
- License: Apache-2.0 (see `licenses/Apache-2.0.txt`)
- Location: `rag_checker/`
- Status: modified. Metric implementations and the evaluator were adapted, and a
  custom weighted LLM-as-judge checker was added.

## RefChecker

- Upstream: https://github.com/amazon-science/RefChecker
- License: Apache-2.0 (see `licenses/Apache-2.0.txt`)
- Usage: consumed as a PyPI dependency (`refchecker`) for claim extraction and
